# The source manuals are deliberately NOT tracked, and must never be.
# They are large, third-party Motorola/NXP copyrighted documents. Everything in
# this repository is derived from them; the root README.md records each one's
# name, byte size and SHA-256 so a local copy can be verified as the exact
# edition the derived material was produced from.
/M68000PRM.pdf
/MC68030EC.pdf
/MC68030UM.pdf
/MC68881UM.pdf

# Any other PDF dropped in the repository root is a source document too.
/*.pdf

__pycache__/
*.pyc
